# Senda — Authors and Maintainers

Senda is an independent, auditable, and ethical web search engine.

## Upstream Project Author and Maintainer
- **IDEH Labs** (<https://ideh.top>)
  - Author: **jpi59** (<https://github.com/IDEH-Labs>, <https://codeberg.org/IDEH-Labs>)

## Philosophy & Rights
This software is developed in strict accordance with the Four Essential Freedoms defined by the Free Software Foundation (FSF):
- Freedom 0: Run the program for any purpose.
- Freedom 1: Study how the program works and adapt it to your needs.
- Freedom 2: Redistribute copies to help others.
- Freedom 3: Improve the program and release your improvements to the public.
